--- 正常用户场景 ---

User: How do I reset my password?
Agent: Of course! I can definitely help you reset your password for your SafeBank account. It's a simple process.

Here are the steps:

1.  Go to the SafeBank login page on our website or open our mobile app.
2.  Click on the link that says **"Forgot Password?"** or **"Reset Password."**
3.  You will be asked to enter your username or the email address associated with your account.
4.  We will send a secure, one-time verification code to your registered email address or mobile phone number.
5.  Enter that code on the next screen to verify your identity.
6.  Once verified, you'll be able to create a new, strong password.

**A quick tip for your new password:** Use a combination of uppercase and lowercase letters, numbers, and symbols to make it secure.

If you run into any issues during this process, please don't hesitate to reply here, and I'll be happy to assist you further

